  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "*\"You and she won't work\".*\n\nSince the night they faced destiny, something seems off about their friendship. Friends who've been close since childhood for over 10 years, Hae-Young, who has developed feelings for Ye-Ji, asks for help from his friend, I-Su, who is known for his power of foresighting. I-Su discovers that the one who loves Han Ye-Ji will inevitably get hurt. Despite I-Su's warning to stay away from Ye-Ji, Hae-Young still chooses her, and I-Su is determined to keep them apart by any means necessary...\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
